  "prefLabel": "Un 811.01 Basic Rule",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Un 811.01 Basic Rule. All students enrolled in credit-bearing programs in any division of the university system of New Hampshire in any capacity shall be charged tuition at a rate to be determined by their domicile. Those domiciled within the State of New Hampshire shall pay the in-state rate. Those domiciled elsewhere shall pay the out-of-state rate.\n\nSource. #2701, eff 5-4-84; ss by #5449, eff 8-25-92, EXPIRED: 8-25-98\n\nNew. #8205, eff 11-17-04, EXPIRED: 11-17-12",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/un800.html"
}
